// cppcheck suppressions: one per intentional violation.
// Format: <id>:<file>:<line>  followed by `// audit:<ID> <rationale>`.
//
// Initial contents: empty. Suppressions added only when an audit-ID-blessed
// exception requires it.
//
// Common categories to expect:
//   missingIncludeSystem  — system includes intentionally not parsed
//   constParameter*       — public C API mutates via callback, doc-known
//   variableScope         — when keeping scope wide aids debugging
